CLAUDE.md
server.log

# Search concurrency lock files (runtime only)
tmp/search_slots/
backend/models/

# Build artefacts of the test run, not the tests themselves.
tests/__pycache__/

# Built frontend. Generated by `npm run build` and rebuilt on the production
# host at every deploy, so it is output rather than source. Tracking it meant
# a stale bundle sat in the repo, every client PR had to carry a rebuilt
# bundle, and a pull could collide with the host's own build output
# (2026-09-09). Every asset in it comes from client/public or the build.
dist/
